# Lab Setup

## Host

- Ubuntu server on an MSI Cyborg 15 laptop
- Targets are isolated from the rest of my network and not exposed to the internet

## Targets

### OWASP Juice Shop
- Intentionally insecure web application
- Used for: XSS, SQL injection, broken access control, authentication flaws

### crAPI (Completely Ridiculous API)
- Intentionally vulnerable API
- Used for: BOLA/IDOR, broken authentication, mass assignment, excessive data exposure

### Metasploitable 2
- Intentionally vulnerable Linux VM
- Used for: Nmap scanning, service enumeration, Metasploit practice
